SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 5 charge
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 0.5
    Mn 1

KINETICS 1
    Calcite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 10.0 0.001
        -step 10 in 100

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step SI_Aragonite
    -start
    10 PUNCH KIN_TIME/10, SI("Aragonite")
    -end

END
